{"ticker":"ISGEC","symbol":"ISGEC","instrumentId":3105801,"name":"Isgec Heavy Engg.","industry":"NSE-Machinery-Gen Industrial","about":"Isgec Heavy Engineering Ltd. is a diversified engineering and manufacturing company specializing in the design, manufacture, and supply of heavy industrial equipment. The company’s extensive product portfolio includes boilers, pressure vessels, heat exchangers, sugar plants, and machinery for steel and cement industries. With state-of-the-art manufacturing facilities and a commitment to quality and innovation, Isgec serves clients in sectors such as power generation, oil and gas, petrochemicals, and fertilizers. The company provides turnkey solutions, including project management and after-sales service, ensuring optimal performance and reliability. Isgec’s global presence and expertise make it a preferred partner for complex engineering projects worldwide.","website":"www.isgec.com","location":"INDIA","exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:31:03.034Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":997.4,"changePct":0.7372992627007328,"week52High":1094.95,"week52Low":694.5},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹7,334 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹7,617 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"27,941,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"105"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"10,174,667"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"0.60%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"2.68"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"1.9"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"19.0%"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"0.09"},{"label":"Beta","value":"0.94"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"13%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"35.19"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"18–49"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"4.0%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"104.04"},{"label":"Volume","value":"31,857"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"76,190"},{"label":"Master score","value":"58"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"45"},{"label":"Price strength","value":